AltoBorrowMarket::setInterestFee
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when market is not paused and skipAccrueInterest is false
    │   └── it should emit accrue event
    ├── when skipAccrueInterest is true
    │   └── it should not emit accrue event
    ├── when market is paused
    │   └── it should not emit accrue event
    ├── it should update interestFee
    ├── it should emit SetInterestFee event
    └── when interestFee is greater than MATH_PRECISION
        └── it should revert

